/* Logon.c - OmniClient logon front-end for setting the default credential.
 *
 * Surfaces a "Log on to Lan Manager" icon in the OmniClient FS-List window.  When the user logs
 * in, this module remembers the (workgroup, username, password) tuple in LM_Vars and tries to
 * locate the user's home share via NetLogon RPC against the primary domain controller, mounting
 * it as "Home" if found.  The credential is reused by Omni_MountServer when the user later mounts
 * other shares without specifying credentials.
 *
 * Sets two RISC OS variables for the !ArmBoot framework: Omni$UserLanMan (login name) and
 * LanMan$HomeDir (home-dir path, suitable for *Dir).
 */

